    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Neajeeda ASEETA aba heeda Baruku",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih ng'asheanda Yeremiya gil was sibaneeda rukusa Baruku orjeeda Neriya, damanda ng'oorsiina ng'asheesu jeeda gitaabu aba ghuuta Yeremiya aba gweaydeaba ang'wan bea Yehoyakimu was orjeeda Yosiya, was sugoocheanda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli, gwayeeshiineey ang'iing'i Ea Baruku: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giyeeni ang'iing'i, ‘Deashageadi aniini! Aba gideaba niiheasa NG'UTAMIIDA sawanadeedeanyu; neaburji aba miyeedeanyu ak ea mwaanyasi fuufta.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeeshiina ang'iing'i niny, Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA: Ng'ula, gidaghayi aadeaschi gaydanyarja, nea gidaghayi eahisti gaydaloosa ng'eanyi ak gaygwanda jeeda ng'eanyiisean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gigakiisi geaw ng'asheega heesi? Adigasayi; aba gideaba ng'ula, gaydeadu ng'asheega munyas badahuuka haleanjeeda sean nyooh gwandeawa saseeda, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA; ak gaydagoonyi eaweagaagu ghoah gichea dagoonyi ea nihi gaydaaghu eaweagaagu aba hiji uwi sean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
